#: includes/Admin/Help.php:80
msgid "Add a service"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/Help.php:82
msgid "Register services in a plugin or the theme. The groups are essential, preferences, statistics, marketing and external-media. The silvertrail_config filter edits or removes anything at the end."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/Help.php:90
msgid "Change a service"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/Help.php:92
msgid "Register a service again by its ID with only the fields to change. A preset’s ID turns the preset on with its defaults, so trackers need only their tag_id. The silvertrail_config filter runs last and can edit or remove any service."
msgstr ""

